# rowcorner.sm -- A part whose flat view at scale 1/4 crowds its ordinates
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# From the fuzzer: the row of ordinates over the flat view spreads past
# its right side, where the column of ordinates right of it spread up
# into the same corner, and two texts overlapped.
sheet 0.5 1.4886 0.3737
plate base 0 18.3555 109.2467 108.9308 at -50.2673 0 0 axes +z +y
flange f0 base -y 123.4003 33.3613
flange f1 base +y 36.509 10.4825 span 30.2491 80.2725
flange f2 f1 +x 90 2.6495 span 113.9523 116.5784
hole hole1 2.2741 57.681 70.6996 along x pattern +y 4 5.0431
hole hole2 0.4661 -56.01 111.8364 along z from 81.57615 to 82.44605
cut cut1 100.4538 27.9244 99.5479 53.3155 along x
hole hole3 9.3394 67.6442 80.0799 along x
